# Pull requests

When creating or editing GitHub pull request descriptions (`gh pr create`, `gh pr edit`):

- Do **not** append "Made with Cursor", "Made with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)", or similar agent or IDE attribution.
- Use the repository pull request template sections only (Preview, Why, What, How to review, Checklist).
